---
import CopyCommand from "./react/CopyCommand.tsx";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-panel text-paper">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-40 top-1/2 h-[520px] w-[520px] -translate-y-1/2 bg-rust/15 blur-[120px]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="shell relative py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.15fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:items-end lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <h2 data-reveal class="display text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,2.7rem)] text-paper">
          看到喜欢的功能，把它弄明白。
        </h2>
        <p data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms" class="mt-6 max-w-[44ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.85] text-panel-body">
          分析在本机运行。设置流程会先展示将要写入的变更，备份已有配置，你确认后才继续。
        </p>

        <div data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms" class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/#start" class="btn btn-rust">开始安装</a>
          <a href="/guides" class="btn btn-on-dark">阅读指南</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:120ms">
        <CopyCommand client:visible command="npx rea-agents setup" size="lg" />

        <dl class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 border-t border-panel-line pt-6">
          <div>
            <dt class="label text-panel-mute">Node.js</dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-[14px] text-panel-text">22.x / 24.x / 26+</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="label text-panel-mute">许可证</dt>
            <dd class="mt-2 text-[14px] text-panel-text">MIT</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>

        <p class="caption mt-8 text-panel-mute">
          GitHub Star 已达 50,000。感谢每一位报告错误、提出需求与贡献修复的朋友。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
